00:16:44,600 --> 00:16:46,420
You said so yourself just now.

249
00:16:46,660 --> 00:16:48,937
There ain't a whole lot of
difference between our kinds.

250
00:16:49,020 --> 00:16:52,880
The only thing is a seal of the
right eye, except for Alice here.

251
00:16:53,120 --> 00:16:55,357
She broke her seal, and according to you,

252
00:16:55,440 --> 00:16:57,637
she's no different than
a real-worlder now.

253
