what are you planning on doing with her?

256
00:17:10,920 --> 00:17:11,750
Sorry.

257
00:17:11,833 --> 00:17:12,663
I can't say.

258
00:17:12,900 --> 00:17:13,820
Not right now.

259
00:17:14,460 --> 00:17:16,578
She should see the real world first.

260
00:17:16,820 --> 00:17:19,938
Then she can decide what
she wants to do for herself.

261
00:17:20,660 --> 00:17:21,740
It's not heaven.

262
00:17:21,840 --> 00:17:23,520
It's no paradise either.

263
00:17:23,980 --> 00:17:24,980
Not even close.

264
00:17:25,180 --> 00:17:27,780
Compared to here, it's not as tranquil.

265
00:17:28,160 --> 00:17:30,640
It's not as pretty or as clean.

266
00:17:30,900 --> 00:17:33,724
But still, there are good
things about my world.

267
00:17:33,860 --> 00:17:35,120
The people, for one.

268
00:17:35,420 --> 00:17:37,097
There's some who'd want to exploit you,

269
00:17:37,180 --> 00:17:39,357
