they can wait until later.

272
00:17:47,900 --> 00:17:50,724
First, we must focus on
breaking the enemy army.

273
00:17:51,020 --> 00:17:54,037
And then we must make peace
with the Dark Territory.

274
00:17:54,120 --> 00:17:56,320
I will not go anywhere until then.

275
00:17:57,040 --> 00:17:57,870
Fine.

276
00:17:58,100 --> 00:17:58,930
Besides,

277
00:17:59,013 --> 00:18:00,937
