287
00:18:27,360 --> 00:18:29,240
This is our world, remember?

288
00:18:30,120 --> 00:18:32,826
Protecting it is our
responsibility, not hers.

289
00:18:33,120 --> 00:18:35,600
Let us show her what we are capable of.

290
00:18:35,900 --> 00:18:37,520
Yes, yes, you are right.

291
00:18:37,780 --> 00:18:39,377
Lady Asuna is not a god.

292
